# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — Global is a mutable VM singleton.
#
# Spec §4.3 / §14 exit-criterion 7: Global.foo = 5 from one session
# becomes visible to all other sessions on the same VM.  Within a
# single-session .chk fixture we verify the write succeeds and the read
# back round-trips.  The genuine cross-session round-trip is exercised
# by tests/unit/test_repl_multi_client.c (Task 33) over real TCP.

> {"id":9,"op":"eval","code":"Global.foo = 11"}
< "id":9 | "kind":"result" | "value":"11"
< "id":9 | "kind":"done"

> {"id":10,"op":"eval","code":"Global.foo"}
< "id":10 | "kind":"result" | "value":"11"
< "id":10 | "kind":"done"
